<title>DUBAI: QUALITY-Lufthansa Sharjah Apr cargo report.</title>
<headline>QUALITY-Lufthansa Sharjah Apr cargo report.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo AG (LCAG), an autonomous unit of Deutsche Lufthansa AG, issued its latest monthly report on service standards achieved at its Sharjah, United Arab Emirates hub.</p>
<p>The report gives results claimed by LCAG Sharjah for April 1997.</p>
<p>  Customer commitment			Achievement</p>
<p>					  Apr 97	Mar 97</p>
<p>Flown as booked			99pct	97pct</p>
<p>Import cargo ready for pick up</p>
<p>-perishables: one hour after</p>
<p>		   flight arrival   100pct     100pct</p>
<p>-general:	five hours after</p>
<p>		   flight arrival   100pct	90pct</p>
<p>Export acceptance waiting time   98pct	97pct</p>
<p>-up to one tonne:    one hour</p>
<p>-one to five tonnes: two hours</p>
<p>-five to 10 tonnes:  three hours</p>
<p>Telephone answered by third ring 81pct	 79pct</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706; fax +5017</p>
</text>
